<view class="page record-page"><view class="record-head"><view><strong>农事记录</strong><text>本人或授权子女都可以填写</text></view><button bindtap="toggle">{{showForm ? '取消' : '新增记录'}}</button></view><view class="family-help"><view><strong>子女远程帮忙</strong><text>长辈授权后代填，系统保留代办人记录</text></view><button bindtap="inviteFamily">邀请子女</button></view><view wx:if="{{showForm}}" class="section"><label class="remote-switch"><view><strong>这是帮家人代填</strong><text>开启后记录会显示代办人</text></view><switch color="#087944" checked="{{remote}}" bindchange="toggleRemote" /></label><label wx:if="{{remote}}" class="form-item"><text class="form-label">代办人姓名及关系</text><input class="input" value="{{helper}}" bindinput="setHelper" placeholder="如：女儿 林小雨" /></label><label class="form-item"><text class="form-label">记录内容</text><input class="input" value="{{title}}" bindinput="setTitle" placeholder="如：水稻病虫害巡查" /></label><label class="form-item"><text class="form-label">关联地块</text><view class="picker">{{plot}}</view></label><button class="primary" bindtap="create">离线保存</button></view><view class="sync-bar"><text>待同步 {{pendingCount}} 条</text><button loading="{{syncing}}" disabled="{{pendingCount === 0}}" bindtap="sync">立即同步</button></view><view class="section record-list"><view class="record-row" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><view class="record-icon">✎</view><view><strong>{{item.title}}</strong><text>{{item.plot}}</text><small>{{item.date}} · {{item.source}}</small></view><text class="status {{item.sync === '已同步' ? 'success' : 'pending'}}">{{item.sync}}</text></view></view></view>
